[{"id":"app-testing-device-offline-unauthorized","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["环境","ADB"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(三)Android 环境与设备.md","articleTitle":"App测试(三)Android 环境与设备","articlePath":"posts/b69bc933/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(三)Android 环境与设备.md","articleTitle":"App测试(三)Android 环境与设备","articlePath":"posts/b69bc933/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>看到设备序列号时，为什么仍不能认为 Android 设备已经可以测试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>还要确认状态为 device，并验证授权、系统版本和测试前置。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>adb devices -l 可能列出 unauthorized 或 offline 设备。前者表示设备尚未接受主机调试授权，后者表示通信链路不稳定；即使状态为 device，也要继续检查 API、屏幕、时间、网络和账号。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>状态\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>含义\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>下一步\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>device\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通信和授权基本可用\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>继续做系统与数据基线\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>unauthorized\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>未接受主机授权\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>解锁设备并确认授权提示\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>offline\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>连接存在但通信不可用\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>重连、检查网络或切回 USB\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>设备状态是进入测试的必要条件，不是完整的环境验收。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-IP-FAQ-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["路由","默认网关"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":15,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>默认网关是不是所有流量的唯一出口？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不是。默认路由只在没有更具体匹配时使用，静态路由、动态路由、策略路由和多网卡都可能让不同目标走不同出口。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>排障时用路由查询确认目标的出接口、源地址和下一跳，不要只看默认网关配置。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可以用一次路由查询把“最具体”变成证据：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ip route get 198.51.100.140\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 重点看：出接口、源地址、下一跳\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>多条路由都匹配时先比较前缀长度，再按设备的管理距离、度量或策略路由规则继续判断；默认路由只是没有更具体匹配时的兜底。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-MOD-007","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["证书","SNI","ALPN"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>证书链、主机名校验、SNI 和 ALPN 各自解决什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>证书链验证信任路径，主机名校验证书是否属于目标，SNI 帮服务端选择虚拟主机，ALPN 协商应用协议版本/协议。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>SNI 不等于信任，ALPN 不等于证书匹配；SAN、有效期、用途和客户端信任库仍需单独验证。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>一次 HTTPS 协商要把身份、协议和密钥分开核对：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察项\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>主要回答\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>不是它负责的\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>证书链/SAN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端身份是否可信且匹配\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务授权\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SNI\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端选择哪个虚拟主机\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>信任本身\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ALPN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选 h2、h3 等应用协议\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>证书匹配\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TLS 密钥\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>传输机密性和完整性\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 方法语义\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-yield-order","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["资源管理","清理"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理","articlePath":"posts/6ddff2f0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理","articlePath":"posts/6ddff2f0/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 依赖的准备和清理顺序如何保证？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>进入依赖时执行 \u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 前代码，处理函数使用资源，响应或异常离开后执行 \u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 后的清理代码。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>把资源放在 \u003ccode>try/finally\u003c/code> 中可以让成功、业务异常和客户端取消都走同一释放路径。嵌套依赖按依赖图进入，退出时反向清理；清理代码若再次抛错可能覆盖原始错误，所以关闭动作要幂等、可记录并尽量保留原始异常上下文。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-db-test-isolation","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["数据库","测试隔离"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/d474d6f1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/d474d6f1/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>数据库测试如何证明每个用例没有相互污染？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>使用独立测试库或事务 fixture，在用例结束回滚/清理，并用下一次查询确认临时记录不存在。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>只重置 Python 对象不能覆盖数据库约束、锁和事务。让用例写入唯一标记，结束时回滚，再在独立查询中断言记录不存在；并发场景还要验证两个事务的冲突状态码和最终行数。测试库的驱动与生产差异也要在集成层保留一组真实验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-graceful-shutdown","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["关闭","资源"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维","articlePath":"posts/a584b159/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维","articlePath":"posts/a584b159/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>优雅关闭需要哪些步骤？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>停止接收新流量，等待或取消在途任务，关闭连接池和消费者，并在超时后退出且留下可恢复状态。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>SIGTERM 到来后先让 readiness 失败或从负载均衡摘除，再处理在途请求。短任务可以等待，长任务应把状态交给持久队列；所有资源在 lifespan 的退出路径释放。关闭窗口不能无限延长，必须记录未完成任务和清理结果，下一次实例才能安全接管。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a6-chmod-umask","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["权限","模式位"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理","articlePath":"posts/5a63b164/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理","articlePath":"posts/5a63b164/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>chmod 和 umask 的作用有什么不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>chmod 修改已有对象模式；umask 参与新建对象的默认权限计算。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>新建对象的默认模式不是简单的“固定值”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">umask\u003c/span> 027\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">touch\u003c/span> report.txt\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">mkdir\u003c/span> report.d\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">stat\u003c/span> -c \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%A %n&#x27;\u003c/span> report.txt report.d\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">chmod\u003c/span> u+rw,go-rwx report.txt\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>umask\u003c/code> 只参与创建时的权限计算，\u003ccode>chmod\u003c/code> 修改已经存在的对象；目录的 \u003ccode>x\u003c/code> 是“能否穿过目录”，不是“能否执行目录”。遇到 Permission denied，依次检查所有者/组、每一级父目录、ACL、挂载选项和服务身份，不要直接把权限放宽到 \u003ccode>777\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-flaky-rerun","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["稳定性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性","articlePath":"posts/5497f9c8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性","articlePath":"posts/5497f9c8/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么重跑通过不能证明 flaky 已修复？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>重跑只改变尝试次数，可能掩盖竞态、资源污染或错误断言；必须保存首次失败证据并重复测量根因。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>一次 rerun 只回答“第二次是否碰巧成功”，不回答“第一次为什么失败”。稳定性实验至少保留输入、worker、seed、解释器版本和首次回溯，并比较串行与并行：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest -q --count=20 tests/test_order.py\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest -n 2 -q --count=20 tests/test_order.py\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>有限 rerun 只适合边界明确的瞬时网络抖动；它不能替代锁、幂等清理、固定时间和可重复输入，也不能让最终退出码掩盖首次失败。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-object-binding","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","赋值","函数参数","名称绑定"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python 函数参数是“传值”还是“传引用”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>形参是局部名称，调用时绑定到传入对象；修改共享可变对象会被调用方看到，重新绑定形参不会。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Python 调用时把形参绑定到传入对象，既没有隐式深拷贝，也不允许函数把调用方的名称重新绑定。对照两个动作即可看出边界：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">change\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">items\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    items.append(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;seen&quot;\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 改共享对象\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    items = []             \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 只改函数内名称\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">items = []\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">change(items)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(items)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [&#x27;seen&#x27;]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此“传值/传引用”的二选一会遮住真正机制：修改共享可变对象会被观察到，重新绑定形参不会。这个模型也能解释默认参数、闭包和 Fixture 中的容器副作用。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]